{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人苟芸慧今日（25日）現身馬場出席珠寶品牌活動，她受訪時透露接下來將會前往內地接拍電視劇及電影，先前亦已順利拍完一套內地劇，笑言因為太久沒有拍劇，這次過程就像是一個很好的Warm-up，重新找回拍戲的節奏，她續指身邊大多是一群非常年輕的演</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.780922+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T10:27:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"a41b963525bac174d0889d0036fbe98e0270832737244c5b4f17599dc43cacd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}